{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54444","headline":"句 · 王舆","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天汉尚不正，河源争得清。\n（见曾慥《类说》卷十二《纪异记》引）（〖1〗《纪异记》：「王舆有诗名，尝有一联云：『天汉尚不正，河源争得清。\n』崔胤相国闻之，大不悦。\n竟流落而死。\n」按：南唐时有王舆，事烈祖，似与此诗作者无涉。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54444.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54444","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}